        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun <strong>kids draw and paint animal game</strong> where children and toddlers can unleash creativity in a <strong>family-friendly</strong> animal <strong>coloring book</strong>! Paint and color cute <strong>dinosaurs</strong>, create digital artworks, and save or share them with friends via computer. This <strong>preschool game</strong> offers <strong>funny educational games</strong> with options to hide dinosaur lines for free drawing on a blank canvas. Perfect for <strong>early learning</strong>, this <strong>baby animal game</strong> promotes creativity and <strong>education</strong> for young artists.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122320/extras/240bb0c7e95cb465cfff6bc0d09de880.poster.avif?t=1762860480\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122320/extras/240bb0c7e95cb465cfff6bc0d09de880.webm?t=1762860480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122320/extras/240bb0c7e95cb465cfff6bc0d09de880.mp4?t=1762860480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And guess what’s cool not just for <strong>Halloween</strong>, <strong>Easter</strong>, or <strong>Christmas</strong>? <strong>DINOSAURS</strong>! It doesn’t always have to be <strong>farm games</strong>—<strong>dinosaurs</strong> are way cooler than sheep, cows, or horses. Get this preschool learning coloring book game for <strong>toddlers</strong> to playfully learn tech skills while having fun with dinos and colors, especially on the <strong>Steam Deck</strong>, where kids and baby's can paint directly on the <strong>touchscreen</strong> display with their fingers. If you love our animal <strong>coloring book</strong>, check out our other coloring books (coming soon) and great <strong>kids games</strong>, educational games and follow our developer page on <strong>STEAM</strong> for new releases and updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parents, we don’t just make <strong>kids games</strong>—check out our minimalist <strong>tower defense</strong> game, <strong>COLONY DEFENSE</strong>, to keep you entertained too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your McPeppergames team</p>",
